                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Delightful Christmas game just right for the festive season.  Bright and cheery graphics with a story about the redemption of Scrooge.  Everyone deserves a second chance even the meanest of them all!!   You discover why he closed his heart to others around him.\nA good solid game which took me 5 hours on advanced mode for the main game and 2 hours for the bonus game.  The bonus game loosely fits into the Christmas theme and is a delight to play for cat lovers.  I found myself chuckling along as I played!\nSlight faults was the music cutting out in HO scenes and a clunkiness picking up HO objects.  Music was festive....see how many tunes you can pick up.  Voiceovers were good.  Puzzles interesting and varying.  There is a morphing penguin in every scene.  Don't get carried away and forget them because you can't go back at the end of the game to pick up the missing ones!!  There is also an instant travel map.\nJust the right tonic for you if you're feeling grumpy!  A winner for all ages.  8/10.",
